100:Before you report done, read the PR back from the forge and confirm it is not a draft (`fgj api repos/<owner>/<repo>/pulls/<number> --hostname <host>` must show `draft` as false, where <owner>/<repo>, <number>, and <host> come from your PR URL); Forgejo marks a draft by a work-in-progress title prefix such as `WIP:`, so if it is a draft, remove that prefix with `fgj api repos/<owner>/<repo>/pulls/<number> --hostname <host> -X PATCH -f title='<title without the prefix>'`.
